window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Samuel has one goal in life: fix his broken core.</b></p> <p>What does he not want? A bossy, overprotective, possessive, teasing dragon sticking his nose in business that is not his.</p> <p>Even if he is sexy and supports Samuel on his quest to find the lost Sousa Mage Clan.</p> <p>Utterly beside the point. He does not need a dragon boyfriend.</p> <p>(Un)fortunately, Dimitri disagrees.</p>"; 
